# Recommended: leave both unset. /api uses Vercel/Vite proxies.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
# Legacy VITE_API_URL is used only when VITE_API_BASE_URL is unset.
# Both accept a server root, /api, /api/v1, or a full events/hackathons endpoint.
# These are public build-time settings; changes require a new build.
# Never place credentials in VITE_ variables. External hosts also require CORS
# and an explicit CSP connect-src entry in vercel.json.
